      "message": "After checking with flags owner, we want floss to fix the flag support instead of facilitating using true flag.\n\nHaving this macro is a sneaky ifdef between android and floss and we would prefer to make this more visible and obvious.\n\nIf there is a need for bypassing a flag for floss, we think this should be done like this:\n\n```\n#ifdef TARGET_FLOSS\n    if (true) {\n#else\n    if (IS_FLAG_ENABLED(l2cap_tx_complete_cb_info)) {\n#endif\n```\n\nBut again go/fluoride-flags-integration should be prioritized in order to have seamless flag integration in floss",
